@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Sign up
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Rhea Sharma",
  "username": "rhea.codes",
  "email": "rhea@example.com",
  "password": "pass1234"
}

### Log in
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "rhea.codes",
  "password": "pass1234"
}

### Current user (paste token from login/signup response above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### List posts (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?page=1&limit=10

### Get single post
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/1

### Create post (text only — paste a token from login/signup above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Hello world, this is my first post!"
}

### Edit post (owner only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Edited content"
}

### Delete post (owner only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

# Note: image upload uses multipart/form-data (field name "image"), which the
# REST Client extension doesn't send well from this file — test that from the
# frontend post form, or with curl:
#   curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts \
#     -H "Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE" \
#     -F "content=Testing image upload" \
#     -F "image=@/path/to/photo.jpg"

### ============ Day 3: Follow System ============

### Follow a user (paste your token + a target user id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/follows/2
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Follow the same user again — expect 409 "already following"
POST {{baseUrl}}/follows/2
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Follow yourself — expect 400 "can't follow yourself"
POST {{baseUrl}}/follows/PASTE_YOUR_OWN_ID
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Unfollow
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/follows/2
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Unfollow again — expect 404 "not following"
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/follows/2
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Followers of a user (paginated, public — token optional, adds isFollowing if sent)
GET {{baseUrl}}/follows/2/followers?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Following list of a user (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/follows/2/following?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Ids the signed-in user follows (used by frontend for button state)
GET {{baseUrl}}/follows/following-ids
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Follow suggestions (mutual connections first, newest users as fallback)
GET {{baseUrl}}/follows/suggestions?limit=8
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Discover — every user on the platform (paginated, excludes yourself)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Public profile + follow counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### --- Day 4: Likes & Comments ---

### Like a post
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/1/like
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Unlike a post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/1/like
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### List comments on a post (paginated, oldest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/1/comments?page=1&limit=20

### Add a comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "This is a comment!"
}

### Delete your own comment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/1/comments/1
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### --- Day 5: Following Feed ---

### Home feed — posts from people you follow, newest first (first page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/feed?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Home feed — next page via cursor returned as nextCursor above
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/feed?limit=10&cursor=PASTE_NEXT_CURSOR_HERE
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
